          "status": null,
          "count": 1,
          "known": true,
          "reason": "`move_cursor()` sends ms.remote.control with TypeOfRemote ProcessMouseDevice. The channel is built to the reference client's contract, which has no pointer; a recording of the frame and of what the set does with it (the UE65U8072F reports mouseWheelSupport) closes the gap."
        }
      ],
